<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 28.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 28.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Estonia's frontier guard fleet is to get new ships.</p>
<p>- Estonia's police protested against low wages.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
